        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRIMJOB</strong> is a small action-arcade game about trimming weeds in a golfly manner! Aim, click and trim across 4 different gardens each with 18 levels inside. Can you get a TRIM-IN-ONE in all 72 levels? - And while you're at it, enjoy the fully handcrafted original soundtrack and satisfying sound effects nicely accompanying the bold retro aesthetics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910080/extras/1a8b9f0658eccac5a737289f22288af8.poster.avif?t=1762437548\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910080/extras/1a8b9f0658eccac5a737289f22288af8.webm?t=1762437548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910080/extras/1a8b9f0658eccac5a737289f22288af8.mp4?t=1762437548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Juicy arcade-style minigolf-ish gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 distinct gardens with 18 levels each (72 levels in total!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 game modes* + practice mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 cool, rare skins to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original slapping soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fresh original voice lines </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stats and achievements for you to obsess over</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Requirements</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse-only (no controller support yet™)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows-only (for now™)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16:9 resolution when fullscreen (otherwise you'll have black bars, which is okay too)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cold drink of your choice (hot drinks not allowed!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*note: the game modes are slightly different ways to go about playing the same 72 levels</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRIMJOB</strong> is a small action-arcade game about trimming weeds in a golfly manner! Aim, click and trim across 4 different gardens each with 18 levels inside. Can you get a TRIM-IN-ONE in all 72 levels? - And while you're at it, enjoy the fully handcrafted original soundtrack and satisfying sound effects nicely accompanying the bold retro aesthetics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910080/extras/1a8b9f0658eccac5a737289f22288af8.poster.avif?t=1762437548\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910080/extras/1a8b9f0658eccac5a737289f22288af8.webm?t=1762437548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910080/extras/1a8b9f0658eccac5a737289f22288af8.mp4?t=1762437548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Juicy arcade-style minigolf-ish gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 distinct gardens with 18 levels each (72 levels in total!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 game modes* + practice mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 cool, rare skins to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original slapping soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fresh original voice lines </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stats and achievements for you to obsess over</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Requirements</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse-only (no controller support yet™)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows-only (for now™)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16:9 resolution when fullscreen (otherwise you'll have black bars, which is okay too)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cold drink of your choice (hot drinks not allowed!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*note: the game modes are slightly different ways to go about playing the same 72 levels</p>",
